<title>USA: U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS - Issues to watch - Dec 5.</title>
<headline>U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS - Issues to watch - Dec 5.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>* Ford Motor Co, unhappy with poor profitability in its core automotive business, is contemplating plant closings in the U.S. and Canada, according to The Wall Street Journal. Ford shares closed at 32-7/8 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>* Navistar International Corp is scheduled to report fourth-quarter earnings. The First Call consensus estimate is for earnings per share of $0.13 versus $0.66 for the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>* Henkel KGaA raises bid for Loctite Corp to $61 per share from $57.75.</p>
</text>
